      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠就被捲進了野生寶可夢們的打鬥裡，\n同時挨了10發的冰凍光束！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72605C3188AB637290324E8691CE751F5BF653EF59225011768462539B2588E1FF0C000A540C664263284E8600310030767C768451B051CD5149675FFF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呆火駝明明是火屬性的，\n結果竟然被凍成硬梆梆融不開的冰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5446706B99DD660E660E662F706B5C6C60277684FF0C000A7D50679C7ADF713688AB51CD6210786C68866886878D4E0D958B768451B0FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "既然連解凍藥都沒效，\n那就只好用熱騰騰的火屬性招式解凍了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E27136902389E351CD85E590FD6C926548FF0C000A90A35C3153EA597D752871B19A309A307684706B5C6C602762DB5F0F89E351CD4E86FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以請讓我拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n用超級炙熱的火屬性招式\n把凍住呆火駝的冰給融化掉吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58ACB8B93621162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0100100001BE01000A75288D857D1A709971B17684706B5C6C602762DB5F0F000A628A51CD4F4F5446706B99DD768451B07D66878D531663895427FF0100100002011401800000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
