      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太棒了！全都融了！\n實在是太感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƀ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
